OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACuts hinder crackdown on vape
OL,4,Asales to children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior official has warned that years
OL,7,Fof budget cuts and austerity have left
OL,8,Ftrading standards enforcement officers
OL,9,Funable to effectively stop retailers
OL,10,Fselling vapes to children.
OL,12,FAlmost a fifth of 11 to 17-year-olds
OL,13,Fsay they have tried vaping, according
OL,14,Fto a national study by charity Action
OL,15,Fon Smoking and Health.
OL,17,FChief executive of the Chartered
OL,18,FTrading Standards Institute, John
OL,19,FHerriman, said the consequence is
OL,20,F"quite significant", and "won't be seen
OL,21,Fimmediately, it'll be seen over a
OL,22,Fperiod of time".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
