OL,3,GNEWSACuts hinder crackdown on vape
OL,4,Asales to children
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said trading standards had been "hit
OL,7,Fhard" by local government cuts, with
OL,8,Fregulatory services reduced by 23%
OL,9,Fbetween 2010 and 2025 and trading
OL,10,Fstandards funding cut by 39%.
